- Battery Holder interacts with Electrical System (e.g., connection) and External Environment (e.g., heat dissipation, user interaction).
- Housing interacts with Bit (e.g., attachment), and External Environment (e.g., protection, ergonomics).
- External Environment interacts with all components as it represents the surroundings in which the screwdriver operates.
